WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.8 · Financial Management
Financial reporting: board, funders and statutory

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Know every financial report you owe, and make every figure come from the same accounts.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List each report, audience, deadline and owner.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Match funder reports to your accounts.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Confirm your legal deadlines with your accountant.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: board pack quarterly; Foundation A in January and July; Foundation B in June and December; audit in February–March.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your financial reporting calendar.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
